1
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,480
Zhang Jie, you don't have to see me out.

2
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:51,799
Be careful on your way.

3
00:01:52,239 --> 00:01:52,719
Will do.

4
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,719
I'll let you know when I get home.

5
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:54,120
All right.

6
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,640
Having come this far,

7
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,680
he didn't give in to cancer,

8
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,280
and he won't back down now.

9
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,719
He knows his son doesn't understand him,

10
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,840
but he doesn't need understanding.

11
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,360
He needs to win.

12
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,319
Especially now.

13
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:37,919
Xiuming,

14
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:40,120
do we really need to buy this bulldozer?

15
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,960
My family already has one.

16
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:43,280
How old is that equipment of yours?

17
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,319
And your dad is rough on equipment.

18
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,520
The engine needs an overhaul,

19
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:46,639
and the tracks need replacing.

20
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:48,039
That'll cost 40,000 to 50,000 yuan.

21
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,960
Even if we take it, we'd still pay for repairs.

22
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:51,000
We might as well buy a new one.

23
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,120
The mixer needs to be replaced, too.

24
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,439
Didn't we already talk about this?

25
00:02:54,439 --> 00:02:55,800
Once our two teams merge,

26
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,159
we'll take on a lot more work.

27
00:02:57,159 --> 00:02:57,879
Without new equipment,

28
00:02:57,879 --> 00:02:59,199
how can we handle all those new jobs?

29
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:01,080
Xiuming, I think

30
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:02,879
you make a good point,

31
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:03,280
but

32
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:05,439
buying equipment is no small matter.

33
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,400
We'll have to spend a lot of money.

34
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:08,919
Besides, that old equipment

35
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:10,319
was bought by Uncle Duoxi and my dad

36
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:11,080
together back then.

37
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:11,919
If we replace it,

38
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:13,479
shouldn't we ask Uncle Duoxi first?

39
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:14,919
If he doesn't agree,

40
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:16,360
we can't just make the call ourselves.

41
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,000
What do you think?

42
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,120
Aren't I the one running this site?

43
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,879
Always asking, asking, asking! Even asking my dad!

44
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:22,919
How am I supposed to get any work done?

45
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:24,240
Why can't even you understand me now?

46
00:03:24,479 --> 00:03:25,800
The deadline is tight and the workload is heavy.

47
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,039
If the equipment breaks down

48
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:27,800
and delays our progress,

49
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:29,280
can you take responsibility for that?

50
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:54,680
Jiao.

51
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:57,879
Jiao.

52
00:03:58,639 --> 00:03:58,879
Did I...

53
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,879
Did I scare you?

54
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,439
After all this time,

55
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:14,159
I thought I wasn't scared anymore.

56
00:04:20,079 --> 00:04:20,680
I'm sorry.

57
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,120
I'm sorry.

58
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:50,680
Look...

59
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:51,759
Listen...

60
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:52,800
Xiuliang, Xiuliang!

61
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,279
Look, no, no, no.

62
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,839
It's not what you think.

63
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,279
It really isn't.

64
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:57,519
What do you think I'm thinking?

65
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,720
We were just... just now,

66
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,800
checking the equipment purchase orders.

67
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,279
I... I startled her a bit,

68
00:05:04,399 --> 00:05:05,360
and she got a little emotional.

69
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,360
I just can't stand seeing people cry.

70
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,639
Then why did she run off?

71
00:05:08,639 --> 00:05:10,759
She... she was just scared by you!

72
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:11,399
What did I do?

73
00:05:11,399 --> 00:05:12,240
I scared her?

74
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:13,519
What did I even do?

75
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:25,839
How long have you two been together?

76
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:26,600
Not that long.

77
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,199
How long is "not that long"?

78
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,199
Who made the first move?

79
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:30,720
No... no one made a move.

80
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,839
Was it just a moment of weakness,

81
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:32,920
or was it premeditated?

82
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:33,839
Premeditated—

83
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:35,959
What nonsense are you spewing?

84
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:36,759
Stop talking rubbish.

85
00:05:36,759 --> 00:05:37,920
How am I talking nonsense?

86
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:39,480
I'm talking rubbish?

87
00:05:39,759 --> 00:05:40,439
Put yourself in my shoes.

88
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,839
Say I was here hugging some woman,

89
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:42,439
and you saw it,

90
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,560
wouldn't you demand an explanation?

91
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:47,480
Xiuming, what are you doing here?

92
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,439
Fooling around like this...

93
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,439
What the hell are you doing?

94
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:50,800
Keep... keep it down.

95
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,040
Don't yell, all right?

96
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,279
Now you're scared?

97
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:54,680
Xiuliang...

98
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,519
I know I was wrong.

99
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:57,240
I know I messed up.

100
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:57,839
Isn't that enough?

101
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:58,959
Just don't say a word.

102
00:05:59,199 --> 00:06:00,279
I'm begging you.

103
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:00,720
Please?

104
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:02,759
You...

105
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,839
First, tell me why you came here today.

106
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:09,639
That thing with Uncle Wei...

107
00:06:10,079 --> 00:06:10,480
the contract,

108
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:11,480
and the ledgers,

109
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,040
hand them all over to me.

110
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,519
The- The contracts are all here.

111
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:26,720
The acc- account books...

112
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:28,839
The account books are with Jia...

113
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,759
With Jia- Jiayin, Jiayin.

114
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,439
So you still remember you have a home?

115
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:36,079
You actually remember you have a home.

116
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,560
So what are you going to do about Wen Jiayin?

117
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,319
Lay your cards on the table?

118
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:38,959
Get a divorce?

119
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:39,759
Divorce? What divorce?

120
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:41,040
I... Your sister-in-law and I...

121
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:41,920
Our relationship is fine. You- You...

122
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:42,759
You two are fine?

123
00:06:42,759 --> 00:06:43,800
And yet you're fooling around behind her back?

124
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,120
I'm not...

125
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:44,800
Why don't you look in the mirror?

126
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,360
Take a look at how old you are!

127
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,480
Your hair's gone completely gray!

128
00:06:47,639 --> 00:06:48,399
Of all things to pick up,

129
00:06:48,399 --> 00:06:49,720
you want a "wife at home,

130
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,879
and mistresses on the side"?

131
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,240
Do you even have what it takes?

132
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:54,000
Can you even clean up after yourself?

133
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:55,480
You can't handle things at home,

134
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,839
and you can't run the site either!

135
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:59,160
No wonder Dad would never trust you with the family!

136
00:06:59,160 --> 00:06:59,759
Enough! I get it!

137
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:00,800
You're completely useless.

138
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,120
All you do is cause trouble.

139
00:07:02,439 --> 00:07:03,000
I messed up.

140
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:04,240
I messed up, all right?

141
00:07:04,399 --> 00:07:05,160
Dad looks down on me.

142
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,000
My wife looks down on me.

143
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,680
I can't do anything right, happy now?

144
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:09,160
I'm just a piece of trash in this house!

145
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,040
What do you all want from me?

146
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,079
Every single one of you treats me like that!

147
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,279
If you guys hadn't treated me that way, I...

148
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,800
would I have ended up like this?

149
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,959
How did we treat you?

150
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,120
So what you're saying is,

151
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,399
it's me, Dad, and your wife...

152
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:18,439
The three of us drove you to this?

153
00:07:18,439 --> 00:07:19,480
Yes! You drove me to it!

154
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,600
You pushed me into becoming like this!

155
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,160
Are you happy now?

156
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,639
What are you doing?

157
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:25,800
Hey, what's with the temper?

158
00:07:25,959 --> 00:07:26,480
What do you want?

159
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,279
The equipment purchase order.

160
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,079
Could you sign it?

161
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:43,199
Talk nicely to Xiuliang. Don't...

162
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:44,279
Fine. Go on, get back to work.

163
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:45,480
Don't fight, okay?

164
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:53,839
Xiuliang.

165
00:07:54,399 --> 00:07:54,720
Xiuliang.

166
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:19,480
Qingyou.

167
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:19,720
Hello.

168
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,040
Did my brother approve that 300,000?

169
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:21,759
This afternoon,

170
00:08:22,439 --> 00:08:23,360
outside the credit union,

171
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,279
let's meet at 2:30.

172
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:26,800
All right, I'll wait for you.

173
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,000
Are you crazy?

174
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:31,040
That fire 18 years ago—

175
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,759
why would you bring it up?

176
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,080
What were you thinking?

177
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,159
What on earth are you trying to do?

178
00:08:36,639 --> 00:08:37,320
I'm telling you,

179
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,759
if you write it like this,

180
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:41,039
he'll destroy us sooner or later.

181
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:41,759
Mark my words!

182
00:08:42,279 --> 00:08:43,360
Dacheng,

183
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:47,879
it was all over the newspapers.

184
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,440
Why can't I mention it?

185
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:50,679
Just remember this:

186
00:08:51,279 --> 00:08:52,559
if he doesn't go down,

187
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,799
we'll never have peace.

188
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,360
Even right now,

189
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,480
if we luck out

190
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,960
and he finds nothing on us,

191
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,080
can you guarantee the future?

192
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,000
Can't you see?

193
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,440
If we want to keep working in the construction team,

194
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,240
this is our only way.

195
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:12,639
If we sign,

196
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,919
we might still survive.

197
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,559
And if we don't?

198
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:20,960
He'll devour us, bones and all.

199
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,720
Jiayin.

200
00:10:00,799 --> 00:10:01,799
It hurts so bad!

201
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,639
What's wrong?

202
00:10:03,639 --> 00:10:05,120
My feet are killing me.

203
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:06,600
What's the matter? What happened?

204
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,159
Sit down, sit down.

205
00:10:07,559 --> 00:10:08,159
It hurts like hell.

206
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:09,759
My clothes! They're getting wrinkled!

207
00:10:09,879 --> 00:10:10,320
The clothes!

208
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:12,799
My bag!

209
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:13,600
You're sitting on my bag!

210
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:15,279
I had to stand on the bus for an hour.

211
00:10:15,279 --> 00:10:17,480
I can't feel my feet anymore.

212
00:10:18,679 --> 00:10:20,840
I shouldn't have dressed up so much for the interview.

213
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,399
So did they hire you or not?

214
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,960
The pay is only 1,500 a month,

215
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,840
yet they can't wait for me to start right away.

216
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,840
They're really taking full advantage.

217
00:10:32,519 --> 00:10:33,279
You've had it rough.

218
00:10:35,039 --> 00:10:35,399
Yeah.

219
00:10:37,519 --> 00:10:39,519
I even prepared an English introduction,

220
00:10:39,759 --> 00:10:40,639
and now look,

221
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,320
they just dumped a pile of chores on me.

222
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,159
Can you understand it?

223
00:10:48,679 --> 00:10:49,919
I can't understand it either!

224
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:52,600
They want me to translate everything into Chinese.

225
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,720
Don't they have a translator?

226
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,679
The translator was hired by the handsome guy himself.

227
00:10:57,279 --> 00:10:58,200
500 an hour.

228
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,320
Peng thought it was too expensive.

229
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,360
Alright, never mind.

230
00:11:03,799 --> 00:11:04,759
As long as we can get in touch with

231
00:11:04,759 --> 00:11:06,039
that foreigner named Dennis,

232
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:07,360
all our trouble won't be in vain.

233
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:08,279
Right.

234
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,360
Snatching food right from the tiger's jaws.

235
00:11:09,679 --> 00:11:10,799
Let's wrap this up quickly.

236
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:15,720
It's Xiuliang.

237
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:17,879
Hello, Xiuliang.

238
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:32,679
Number 002 for corporate banking, please go to counter three.

239
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,519
Wait, don't rush.

240
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:37,120
Listen to me.

241
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:38,919
Lao San.

242
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,200
Give me the money first.

243
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,399
I said, don't... don't rush.

244
00:11:41,759 --> 00:11:43,080
If you take this money,

245
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,200
it's no joke.

246
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,120
Can't people have

247
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,720
some basic trust between each other?

248
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,919
That's not what I mean.

249
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:48,840
Isn't my last name Sai?

250
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,360
Doesn't the construction site belong to the Sais?

251
00:11:50,679 --> 00:11:51,799
I'm just taking our family's money

252
00:11:51,799 --> 00:11:52,679
for a quick turnover.

253
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,840
I'll even give you a cut.

254
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,519
I... I'm telling you, Lao San,

255
00:11:55,919 --> 00:11:57,639
you can only use this money for three days.

256
00:11:57,799 --> 00:11:58,279
When the time comes,

257
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,600
pay it back promptly.

258
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,080
Three days.

259
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,159
Just three days.

260
00:12:01,279 --> 00:12:02,799
I'll bring it back with interest, guaranteed.

261
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,399
Pay it back early, and no one will ever know.

262
00:12:04,399 --> 00:12:04,720
Bro,

263
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,120
in all the time I've known you,

264
00:12:06,279 --> 00:12:07,720
you've never looked cooler than today.

265
00:12:07,919 --> 00:12:09,919
A real man has to be decisive when making money.

266
00:12:10,039 --> 00:12:10,320
Right.

267
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:10,840
Got that?

268
00:12:10,919 --> 00:12:11,159
Right.

269
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,000
Pay it back right on schedule.

270
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:15,120
Bro,

271
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:17,600
what if... just what if

272
00:12:17,759 --> 00:12:18,960
I need three more days?

273
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,039
Then you'll have to explain it to them yourself.

274
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:21,879
I said three days.

275
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,519
Just tell them the bank ran out of cash.

276
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:24,320
Only three days, okay?

277
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:25,720
Strictly three days, Lao San.

278
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,480
Did you hear me?

279
00:12:29,159 --> 00:12:30,240
With so many account books

280
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,840
and all those old contracts,

281
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:33,399
there's a lot involved.

282
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:36,080
Just checking through these

283
00:12:36,399 --> 00:12:37,320
will take you days,

284
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,559
and you might not even make sense of it.

285
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,559
Jiayin, how is

286
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,440
your bridal studio coming along?

287
00:12:50,399 --> 00:12:50,879
It's all right.

288
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,480
Just getting started.

289
00:12:53,039 --> 00:12:53,799
Not much business yet.

290
00:12:54,879 --> 00:12:55,879
Why ask out of the blue?

291
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:57,840
I just

292
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,519
wanted to see if you and Qianjin

293
00:13:01,639 --> 00:13:03,000
needed any help.

294
00:13:05,399 --> 00:13:06,200
Not for now.

295
00:13:06,679 --> 00:13:07,279
Thanks, though.

296
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,039
Do you really think

297
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,639
there's any point in keeping our construction team going?

298
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,240
What do you mean?

299
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:23,879
I mean,

300
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:26,919
there's actually a lot

301
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:27,919
you folks don't know about.

302
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:29,960
This whole situation

303
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:32,000
is far trickier than you think.

304
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,360
Tengyue is acquiring Changfu,

305
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:36,000
and they're determined to standardize everything.

306
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:38,080
That's why they must clear out the Sais and the Mas.

307
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,399
Everything you're saying,

308
00:13:39,919 --> 00:13:41,519
Dad and your older brother are well aware of it.

309
00:13:41,879 --> 00:13:43,200
Once we get through this,

310
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,320
they'll sit down and talk it over.

311
00:13:54,399 --> 00:13:55,399
Actually, what I mean is...

312
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:56,840
why don't we take this chance to...

313
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,120
Go talk it over with the old man,

314
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:00,559
and just...

315
00:14:01,159 --> 00:14:02,440
shut down the construction team for good.

316
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:03,559
Shut it down?

317
00:14:04,759 --> 00:14:05,799
It's easy for you to talk,

318
00:14:05,799 --> 00:14:07,039
making it sound so simple.

319
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:10,039
Our family relies on the team to put food on the table!

320
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,600
Never mind that Xiuhe isn't married and Xiuli's underage,

321
00:14:12,799 --> 00:14:13,559
just look at Xiuming!

322
00:14:13,879 --> 00:14:14,759
This is the only thing he knows how to do.

323
00:14:14,759 --> 00:14:15,799
If—if you shut down the team,

324
00:14:15,799 --> 00:14:16,639
what's he supposed to do?

325
00:14:16,799 --> 00:14:19,440
Do you really think he's cut out for this?

326
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:20,320
What he's truly capable of...

327
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,519
don't you know in your heart?

328
00:14:21,799 --> 00:14:23,639
Can he really take over the old man's business for life?

329
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:24,919
The old man can protect him for a while,

330
00:14:24,919 --> 00:14:25,879
but can he protect him forever?

331
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,399
Take my advice, Jiayin.

332
00:14:27,639 --> 00:14:28,519
Let him come home,

333
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:30,639
and live a quiet, steady life together.

334
00:14:30,639 --> 00:14:31,360
Isn't that better?

335
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:31,759
Sai Xiuliang!

336
00:14:31,759 --> 00:14:32,120
Must you—

337
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,360
How can you talk about Xiuming like that?

338
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:34,799
Sure,

339
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,399
he's not as capable as you,

340
00:14:36,759 --> 00:14:37,639
nor as slick with people.

341
00:14:38,159 --> 00:14:39,159
But he's always been earnest,

342
00:14:39,159 --> 00:14:40,279
working hard all along!

343
00:14:40,399 --> 00:14:40,840
That's not what I'm saying—

344
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,360
Just look, ever since Dad was hospitalized,

345
00:14:53,679 --> 00:14:54,799
If Xiuming hadn't been out front

346
00:14:54,799 --> 00:14:56,000
dealing with all that crap,

347
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,080
you wouldn't be where you are today!

348
00:14:57,399 --> 00:14:58,360
Where's your conscience?

349
00:14:58,679 --> 00:14:59,600
Yet look at you,

350
00:14:59,759 --> 00:15:01,360
talking behind Xiuming's back!

351
00:15:01,639 --> 00:15:02,360
What you just said—

352
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:02,960
if you've got the guts,

353
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:04,039
wait until Xiuming gets back

354
00:15:04,039 --> 00:15:05,279
and say it to his face!

355
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,000
What are you saying to her?

356
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:07,799
Don't talk nonsense!

357
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:08,320
If you talk nonsense,

358
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,159
I'll tear you apart!

359
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,480
Stop talking nonsense here,

360
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,240
all right?

361
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:11,879
Let go! Let go!

362
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,879
There's no need for this!

363
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:14,600
What are you doing?

364
00:15:14,679 --> 00:15:15,840
Getting physical now?

365
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:17,559
I wasn't...

366
00:15:18,039 --> 00:15:18,840
I saw you just now...

367
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:20,840
Why were you so...

368
00:15:21,679 --> 00:15:22,200
so worked up?

369
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:23,399
I thought he was bullying you.

370
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:50,480
Jiayin,

371
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,159
about what I just said,

372
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:53,960
really think it over.

373
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,919
You should think about it too.

374
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:02,960
Just think about it!

375
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:10,720
Xiuliang,

376
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:12,679
if there's anything you don't understand,

377
00:16:12,679 --> 00:16:13,759
feel free to ask anytime.

378
00:16:14,519 --> 00:16:14,879
All right.

379
00:16:16,519 --> 00:16:18,320
Sai Xiuliang never imagined

380
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,639
that one day he would

381
00:16:20,639 --> 00:16:23,080
feel so outraged on Wen Jiayin's behalf.

382
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:30,679
You...

383
00:16:31,759 --> 00:16:32,360
What's wrong with you?

384
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:33,840
What did Xiuliang tell you?

385
00:16:35,039 --> 00:16:36,320
What could he say?

386
00:16:36,799 --> 00:16:38,440
Just about Changfu being acquired.

387
00:16:38,799 --> 00:16:39,840
With all our ties

388
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:40,960
to Changfu,

389
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,960
he's afraid Tengyue will find dirt on us.

390
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:43,799
Then we'd be in deep trouble.

391
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:47,240
He didn't... didn't say anything else.

392
00:16:49,279 --> 00:16:49,960
What else would there be?

393
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:51,080
Nothing else.

394
00:16:51,559 --> 00:16:52,759
I was just asking.

395
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:56,080
I... I say let them audit us.

396
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,399
It's happened before.

397
00:16:57,759 --> 00:16:58,799
We've always gotten through it.

398
00:16:58,919 --> 00:17:00,039
Once... once this blows over,

399
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,200
we'll register a new company,

400
00:17:01,679 --> 00:17:02,519
and everything will be fine.

401
00:17:02,919 --> 00:17:04,319
I want to use this opportunity

402
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,359
to make things clear with Dad.

403
00:17:06,599 --> 00:17:07,599
If we start a company,

404
00:17:07,599 --> 00:17:08,559
what's our status?

405
00:17:08,559 --> 00:17:09,440
Are we employees,

406
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:10,160
or shareholders?

407
00:17:10,279 --> 00:17:11,240
How much equity do we get?

408
00:17:11,519 --> 00:17:12,440
If we never bring it up,

409
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:13,640
we'll just end up working for Dad again.

410
00:17:13,839 --> 00:17:15,359
How much we make will be entirely up to him.

411
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:16,720
What's in it for us?

412
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:17,880
"What's in it for us?"

413
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:19,079
We're all family.

414
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:20,160
What else would it be for?

415
00:17:20,599 --> 00:17:21,839
Xiuming, listen to me.

416
00:17:22,559 --> 00:17:24,440
I'm not telling you to fight Dad.

417
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,480
I just want you

418
00:17:26,079 --> 00:17:27,200
to think of yourself,

419
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,000
and think of our family.

420
00:17:29,119 --> 00:17:29,759
What's rightfully ours,

421
00:17:29,839 --> 00:17:31,319
we should hold onto tightly.

422
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,720
Otherwise, when will we ever get ahead?

423
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:33,240
Are you done?

424
00:17:34,079 --> 00:17:35,240
Just nagging all day long.

425
00:17:35,559 --> 00:17:36,799
Come on, every time I bring this up,

426
00:17:36,799 --> 00:17:37,759
you give me this attitude.

427
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,839
Aren't I doing this for your own good?

428
00:17:41,519 --> 00:17:42,440
Isn't it for your own good?

429
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:45,799
To be honest,

430
00:17:46,119 --> 00:17:46,960
this time, for your sake,

431
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:48,680
I completely offended Ma Laibu.

432
00:17:49,119 --> 00:17:50,119
I wonder what he'll do once he knows...

433
00:17:50,119 --> 00:17:50,759
Come on.

434
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:51,559
You and Ma Laibu...

435
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:52,880
I was the one who introduced you two.

436
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:54,200
Why worry about offending him?

437
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,759
All he gave you were empty promises.

438
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:57,640
I paid a real cash deposit.

439
00:17:58,319 --> 00:17:59,319
All that matters is hitting your numbers.

440
00:17:59,319 --> 00:18:00,000
Why care about the rest?

441
00:18:00,119 --> 00:18:00,400
Right.

442
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:01,359
You're the ruthless one.

443
00:18:01,359 --> 00:18:02,839
I actually really like this apartment.

444
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:04,559
There are fewer than ten units left.

445
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,359
A 30% down payment

446
00:18:06,359 --> 00:18:07,720
comes to 480,000.

447
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,440
Now that your housing fund has stopped,

448
00:18:09,559 --> 00:18:11,519
if I have to pay the mortgage alone,

449
00:18:11,759 --> 00:18:12,880
it'll be a bit tight.

450
00:18:13,519 --> 00:18:13,960
What do you think?

451
00:18:14,279 --> 00:18:14,680
Do you like it?

452
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,319
How's the house?

453
00:18:18,759 --> 00:18:19,759
The... The house is fine.

454
00:18:19,759 --> 00:18:21,000
But there are plenty of good houses.

455
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,359
Money's really tight right now.

456
00:18:22,759 --> 00:18:24,240
What's with your attitude?

457
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:25,559
You're totally distracted.

458
00:18:26,079 --> 00:18:26,680
Don't you want to buy it anymore?

459
00:18:29,079 --> 00:18:29,880
Let me tell you something.

460
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,599
I went to the construction site today,

461
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:34,720
and saw Xiuming and Ma Laijiao...

462
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:36,440
The two of them...

463
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,240
What about them?

464
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,759
They were hugging each other.

465
00:18:39,839 --> 00:18:41,559
Of course, a hug might not mean anything,

466
00:18:41,759 --> 00:18:42,079
but...

467
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,440
the moment she saw me,

468
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,160
she ran away.

469
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,599
Isn't that obvious enough?

470
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:48,599
Did Xiuming admit it?

471
00:18:51,319 --> 00:18:52,359
Did you tell Jiayin?

472
00:18:53,319 --> 00:18:54,839
Right after that, I went to Qingyangli

473
00:18:55,279 --> 00:18:55,839
to pick up the account books.

474
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:57,440
In front of Jiayin, I...

475
00:18:58,039 --> 00:18:59,279
started to speak several times,

476
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,960
but I just didn't know what to say.

477
00:19:01,599 --> 00:19:02,240
So I kept quiet.

478
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:02,799
Still,

479
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,200
you can't keep a lid on this forever.

480
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,519
She's bound to find out sooner or later.

481
00:19:06,839 --> 00:19:07,680
And then what happens?

482
00:19:08,079 --> 00:19:08,519
A divorce?

483
00:19:09,039 --> 00:19:10,000
Zhenzhu is still so young,

484
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,599
and the old man will never accept it.

485
00:19:11,759 --> 00:19:12,559
And what happens after a divorce?

486
00:19:12,559 --> 00:19:13,480
Marry Ma Laijiao?

487
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,640
How will he face his old buddies?

488
00:19:15,640 --> 00:19:16,680
What will Uncle Ma think?

489
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,720
You're worrying way too far ahead.

490
00:19:19,079 --> 00:19:20,519
Just go ask Xiuming right now,

491
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:22,039
and see where he stands.

492
00:19:23,039 --> 00:19:23,680
I mean, really...

493
00:19:24,559 --> 00:19:26,119
Has Ma Laijiao lost her mind?

494
00:19:26,559 --> 00:19:28,119
What does she even see in him?

495
00:19:28,119 --> 00:19:29,039
What is she after?

496
00:19:29,039 --> 00:19:29,839
Right?

497
00:19:30,079 --> 00:19:31,440
I'd think if anyone cheated,

498
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:32,680
it should've been Jiayin.

499
00:19:33,319 --> 00:19:34,240
What kind of nonsense is that?

500
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:34,839
Why on earth does someone

501
00:19:34,839 --> 00:19:36,400
in their family have to cheat anyway?

502
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,680
Help me figure out what to do.

503
00:19:38,279 --> 00:19:39,200
What can you do?

504
00:19:48,079 --> 00:19:49,400
Wait...

505
00:19:50,279 --> 00:19:51,279
What are you doing?

506
00:19:53,519 --> 00:19:54,279
No, no, no.

507
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:55,119
I'm busy.

508
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:56,279
No, no, no.

509
00:19:58,839 --> 00:20:00,519
An elegant curve at the waist,

510
00:20:00,599 --> 00:20:01,880
like the graceful neck of a swan.

511
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:04,000
What are you laughing at?

512
00:20:05,359 --> 00:20:06,240
That's ridiculous.

513
00:20:06,519 --> 00:20:09,039
Whose waist could look like a swan's?

514
00:20:09,319 --> 00:20:10,240
Who wrote this?

515
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,720
It makes no sense at all.

516
00:20:11,799 --> 00:20:13,279
What are you babbling about?

517
00:20:13,279 --> 00:20:14,559
I don't understand.

518
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,680
That word starting with S,

519
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:19,480
it's like...

520
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:22,799
A duck.

521
00:20:23,039 --> 00:20:23,799
No, not a duck.

522
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:29,640
A swan.

523
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:30,839
Right, right, right.

524
00:20:30,839 --> 00:20:31,680
How did you pronounce that again?

525
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:33,079
Tian.

526
00:20:33,279 --> 00:20:33,759
Tian.

527
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:34,680
E.

528
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,480
E.

529
00:20:35,599 --> 00:20:35,960
Tian'e.

530
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:36,240
Tian'e.

531
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:37,640
Tian'e.

532
00:20:38,079 --> 00:20:39,759
Draw a swan right here.

533
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:41,519
It's like right here...

534
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:42,680
The waist.

535
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:43,240
Right.

536
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:43,680
The waist.

537
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:44,200
Looks like...

538
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:45,480
The neck.

539
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:46,400
The neck.

540
00:20:46,519 --> 00:20:47,240
Right, the neck.

541
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,079
Waist.

542
00:20:48,880 --> 00:20:51,640
A swan's neck.

543
00:20:54,559 --> 00:20:56,680
The curve of the waist,

544
00:20:57,319 --> 00:20:58,839
just like

545
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:02,839
the graceful

546
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:06,000
lines of a swan's neck.

547
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:09,279
Aren't I amazing?

548
00:21:09,839 --> 00:21:10,119
Alright.

549
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,000
You... You...

550
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,240
Sit down.

551
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:13,559
Help me.

552
00:21:13,559 --> 00:21:14,759
No, no. Even though I want to help,

553
00:21:14,759 --> 00:21:15,880
I want to go eat. Count me out.

554
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,079
No, no, don't eat now.

555
00:21:17,079 --> 00:21:18,759
You... You can... Come help me.

556
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:20,160
Come here, come here.

557
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:21,519
Okay?

558
00:21:21,839 --> 00:21:22,119
No.

559
00:21:23,079 --> 00:21:23,839
Please?

560
00:21:25,359 --> 00:21:28,000
Wait, wait, wait.

561
00:21:32,359 --> 00:21:33,200
A dress.

562
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:35,559
I'll give you a pretty dress.

563
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:36,000
For me?

564
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:36,839
If I help you make it, you'll give it to me?

565
00:21:36,839 --> 00:21:38,160
Yeah, come help me.

566
00:21:38,359 --> 00:21:38,720
Deal.

567
00:21:38,839 --> 00:21:39,799
You help me, okay?

568
00:21:39,799 --> 00:21:40,319
Deal.

569
00:21:40,319 --> 00:21:41,079
Good, good.

570
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:43,000
Come on, come on, come on.

571
00:21:43,519 --> 00:21:44,920
Multi-layered. Okay, multi-layered...

572
00:21:46,839 --> 00:21:47,559
Here, this one.

573
00:21:47,759 --> 00:21:48,359
Multi-layered...

574
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:49,519
Multi-layered...

575
00:21:49,839 --> 00:21:50,839
This one, right.

576
00:21:51,599 --> 00:21:53,119
Tulle.

577
00:21:54,519 --> 00:21:54,799
This.

578
00:21:54,799 --> 00:21:55,119
Mist.

579
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:57,599
Morning.

580
00:21:57,960 --> 00:22:00,079
Beautiful like the morning, beautiful like the morning.

581
00:22:00,319 --> 00:22:06,559
Evoking the morning mist,

582
00:22:07,319 --> 00:22:08,839
with a hazy, ethereal beauty,

583
00:22:09,279 --> 00:22:12,519
as if every single step

584
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:18,960
were a dance upon the clouds.

585
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:23,720
All done!

586
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:31,640
Thank you.

587
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:48,519
Xiuming bought an old hen at the market yesterday,

588
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:49,799
and this morning,

589
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:51,279
I started stewing it early.

590
00:22:51,279 --> 00:22:52,000
Thank you for your trouble.

591
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:53,599
It smells wonderful.

592
00:22:54,359 --> 00:22:54,839
Doesn't it?

593
00:22:55,079 --> 00:22:55,400
Dad,

594
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:58,279
are you feeling any better today?

595
00:22:59,039 --> 00:23:00,240
Much better, much better.

596
00:23:01,839 --> 00:23:04,319
Did Xiuliang come see you?

597
00:23:05,799 --> 00:23:06,640
The... the day before yesterday.

598
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:09,000
He came home the day before yesterday.

599
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:12,319
I... I originally

600
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:14,920
didn't want to bring this up with you,

601
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:16,440
but when Xiuliang came home,

602
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:17,759
he was scowling

603
00:23:17,759 --> 00:23:18,759
and giving us nasty attitude.

604
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:20,240
We had agreed

605
00:23:20,559 --> 00:23:21,680
to use the reconciled accounts

606
00:23:21,759 --> 00:23:23,200
and go through the contracts again.

607
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:24,440
Before I even got back,

608
00:23:24,799 --> 00:23:25,920
he and Jiayin

609
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:26,519
got into a fight.

610
00:23:27,279 --> 00:23:27,759
The two of them.

611
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:28,559
Dad,

612
00:23:29,200 --> 00:23:30,119
don't worry.

613
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:31,440
They didn't fight.

614
00:23:31,720 --> 00:23:33,920
Things just got a bit heated, that's all.

615
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:34,920
You call that just getting heated?

616
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:36,640
Dad,

617
00:23:37,079 --> 00:23:38,839
if the accounts aren't sorted out,

618
00:23:39,079 --> 00:23:40,359
we can't check the contracts, right?

619
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:41,640
And if we can't check the contracts,

620
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:43,359
our family won't survive this hurdle, will we?

621
00:23:43,519 --> 00:23:44,680
I... I see it clearly now.

622
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:45,720
Xiuliang's heart

623
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:47,640
isn't with our family at all.

624
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,319
He can't wait to use this chance

625
00:23:49,599 --> 00:23:50,519
to shut down the business!

626
00:23:50,519 --> 00:23:51,160
The construction team—

627
00:23:52,039 --> 00:23:52,759
Why are you nudging me?

628
00:23:52,839 --> 00:23:54,160
He just wants the construction team disbanded!

629
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:54,799
His ass

630
00:23:54,799 --> 00:23:56,359
is planted firmly in Tengyue's camp!

631
00:23:56,359 --> 00:23:57,240
He's out to screw us into the ground!

632
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:00,200
Even if Xiuliang is wrong,

633
00:24:00,559 --> 00:24:02,279
don't you bear any blame as the eldest brother?

634
00:24:02,599 --> 00:24:03,839
You're the eldest.

635
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:05,720
When your younger brothers mess up,

636
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:06,759
you should rein them in!

637
00:24:07,039 --> 00:24:08,279
Complain, complain...

638
00:24:08,880 --> 00:24:09,799
Does tattling do any good?

639
00:24:10,039 --> 00:24:11,279
Being able to solve problems—

640
00:24:11,279 --> 00:24:12,559
that's what takes real ability.

641
00:24:13,119 --> 00:24:14,200
We're all one family.

642
00:24:15,359 --> 00:24:16,720
Even if we aren't of one mind,

643
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:18,559
we should still pull together as one!

644
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:20,079
Look at the mess we're in right now!

645
00:24:30,359 --> 00:24:30,680
All right.

646
00:24:32,559 --> 00:24:33,759
Hurry up.

647
00:24:35,319 --> 00:24:36,279
Have Qingyou

648
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:39,000
go to Old Wei's

649
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:40,920
and reconcile the accounts right away.

650
00:24:42,559 --> 00:24:45,119
On the site, apart from the workers' wages

651
00:24:45,559 --> 00:24:47,400
and payments for materials,

652
00:24:47,839 --> 00:24:49,160
don't touch a single penny.

653
00:24:49,359 --> 00:24:50,759
We have to tighten our belts now.

654
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:52,640
Let's hold on to this money.

655
00:24:55,119 --> 00:24:55,519
Xiuming,

656
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:59,599
we must prepare for the worst.

657
00:25:02,839 --> 00:25:03,960
This hurdle...

658
00:25:04,039 --> 00:25:06,079
I really don't know if we'll make it through.

659
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:07,559
Dad,

660
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:09,799
I'll go to the site with Xiuming

661
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:11,160
and brief Qingyou.

662
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:13,720
Xiuming,

663
00:25:14,319 --> 00:25:14,599
let's go.

664
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:17,279
Dad, don't clean up after you eat.

665
00:25:17,279 --> 00:25:18,079
I'll be back shortly.

666
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:18,960
Come on, hurry.

667
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:28,079
I need to tell you something.

668
00:25:28,119 --> 00:25:28,680
What is it?

669
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:31,279
A couple days ago, didn't I sign off on a request

670
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:34,480
to let Qingyou draw some funds?

671
00:25:35,079 --> 00:25:35,519
What funds?

672
00:25:35,759 --> 00:25:36,759
You didn't know?

673
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,400
The money to buy equipment.

674
00:25:38,519 --> 00:25:39,640
Didn't I tell you not to buy it?

675
00:25:40,119 --> 00:25:41,160
He came to me for my signature,

676
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:41,759
so I approved it.

677
00:25:41,759 --> 00:25:42,400
Besides,

678
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:43,799
I already negotiated with them.

679
00:25:43,799 --> 00:25:44,279
It was a done deal.

680
00:25:44,279 --> 00:25:45,000
If I back out now,

681
00:25:45,119 --> 00:25:47,039
how will that make me look?

682
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,480
Go marry your damn pride!

683
00:25:49,319 --> 00:25:49,759
Look at you...

684
00:25:52,920 --> 00:25:53,599
How much was drawn?

685
00:25:54,440 --> 00:25:55,200
Around 300,000.

686
00:25:58,119 --> 00:25:58,960
Sai Xiuming!

687
00:25:59,440 --> 00:26:00,079
You just love crossing me, don't you?

688
00:26:00,079 --> 00:26:00,519
What's with you?

689
00:26:00,799 --> 00:26:01,640
We're family.

690
00:26:01,839 --> 00:26:02,599
Would I ever harm you?

691
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:03,599
What is wrong with you?

692
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:03,960
What are you doing?

693
00:26:03,960 --> 00:26:04,400
That's so much money!

694
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:05,640
We're in a hospital, keep it down.

695
00:26:07,720 --> 00:26:08,799
Go tell Dad.

696
00:26:09,160 --> 00:26:09,759
Go on, tell him!

697
00:26:10,640 --> 00:26:11,880
I'm trying to discuss it with you, come on...

698
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:13,599
Why bring Dad into this?

699
00:26:17,839 --> 00:26:19,039
Hello, Jiayin.

700
00:26:19,039 --> 00:26:19,559
Yang Qingyou.

701
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:23,079
What did I tell you?

702
00:26:24,319 --> 00:26:25,640
Didn't I tell you not to release that money?

703
00:26:25,839 --> 00:26:26,559
Who authorized you to transfer it?

704
00:26:27,279 --> 00:26:28,119
You just don't listen to me anymore,

705
00:26:28,119 --> 00:26:28,480
do you?

706
00:26:29,119 --> 00:26:32,240
Jiayin, if Xiuming wouldn't listen to you,

707
00:26:32,240 --> 00:26:33,519
what was I supposed to do?

708
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:34,880
I had no choice.

709
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:35,519
Has the money been sent?

710
00:26:35,839 --> 00:26:36,319
It's paid.

711
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:37,440
Let me tell you,

712
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:39,000
no matter what it takes,

713
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:40,240
get that money back for me!

714
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:41,559
I already paid them.

715
00:26:41,559 --> 00:26:41,880
You...

716
00:26:42,319 --> 00:26:44,000
It's impossible to get it back right away!

717
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:44,920
The site needs to freeze the accounts.

718
00:26:45,279 --> 00:26:45,920
It must be recovered.

719
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:46,720
Who did you pay?

720
00:26:46,920 --> 00:26:47,519
I'll go demand it back with you.

721
00:26:47,799 --> 00:26:49,160
Don't, please don't, Jiayin.

722
00:26:49,559 --> 00:26:50,319
If you go there,

723
00:26:50,319 --> 00:26:51,880
it'll make Xiuming look bad.

724
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:52,720
He'll lose face.

725
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:53,480
Just go get it back, now!

726
00:26:53,839 --> 00:26:54,839
All right, that's enough.

727
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:55,680
Stop yammering.

728
00:26:56,119 --> 00:26:57,000
Just listen to Jiayin.

729
00:27:01,759 --> 00:27:02,440
What are we supposed to do?

730
00:27:05,400 --> 00:27:06,759
Give it here! Hang up the phone!

731
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:08,359
You're such an idiot!

732
00:27:09,119 --> 00:27:09,640
Let me tell you,

733
00:27:09,720 --> 00:27:12,119
folks from Qingyangli would never scam their own.

734
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:13,640
Zhang, this one's 88 square meters.

735
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:14,160
Since you're single,

736
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,279
88 square meters is perfect for you.

737
00:27:15,359 --> 00:27:15,640
Exactly.

738
00:27:15,839 --> 00:27:17,519
He, your kid's due next year, right?

739
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:19,400
This 128-square-meter school district place—

740
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:19,920
So this is where you guys are!

741
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:20,519
Qingyou!

742
00:27:20,880 --> 00:27:21,640
Lao San, a word with you.

743
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:22,599
Hold on, I'm busy right now.

744
00:27:22,799 --> 00:27:23,519
It's a split-bedroom layout.

745
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:25,000
Schools, malls, everything's right there.

746
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:26,359
Isn't your baby on the way next year?

747
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:27,720
Just one word, hurry!

748
00:27:27,799 --> 00:27:28,599
Let me talk to him for a second.

749
00:27:28,599 --> 00:27:29,519
Take a look, browse around.

750
00:27:29,799 --> 00:27:30,359
Alright, sure.

751
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:31,480
What's up?

752
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:32,200
It's an emergency.

753
00:27:32,599 --> 00:27:33,240
A real emergency.

754
00:27:33,680 --> 00:27:35,480
Xiuming and Jiayin just called me.

755
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:36,960
Said your dad wants to freeze the accounts.

756
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:38,559
Give me back that 300,000 right now.

757
00:27:38,559 --> 00:27:39,400
I already spent the 300,000.

758
00:27:40,200 --> 00:27:40,839
How long has it even been?

759
00:27:40,839 --> 00:27:41,640
You already blew through 300,000?!

760
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:43,160
I bought five units at 60,000 each.

761
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:44,319
I already signed the contracts.

762
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:46,200
You spent it all that fast?!

763
00:27:46,759 --> 00:27:47,640
No, listen, I have to freeze the accounts!

764
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:48,759
Do you even know what freezing the accounts means?

765
00:27:48,759 --> 00:27:49,359
No, I don't!

766
00:27:49,839 --> 00:27:50,160
Look...

767
00:27:50,160 --> 00:27:51,920
I know the old man's in the hospital.

768
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:53,240
He hasn't been discharged yet, don't panic.

769
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:54,200
Xiuming, you'll have to figure something out!

770
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:57,559
Let's check it out.

771
00:27:57,559 --> 00:27:58,480
Over here, look over here!

772
00:27:58,680 --> 00:27:59,599
Come on, I'll take you there.

773
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:00,400
Sounds good.

774
00:28:00,400 --> 00:28:01,279
How about this? Let's check out the actual units.

775
00:28:01,759 --> 00:28:02,119
Lao San!

776
00:28:02,359 --> 00:28:03,759
I saved that apartment for you!

777
00:28:03,759 --> 00:28:04,559
Don't worry, relax!

778
00:28:04,680 --> 00:28:05,240
Let's go, let's go.

779
00:28:06,279 --> 00:28:06,680
Let me tell you,

780
00:28:06,680 --> 00:28:08,200
amenities are everything these days.

781
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:09,960
Look at this one.

782
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:17,599
Jiao,

783
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:19,160
there are three rooms.

784
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,519
You take the master bedroom.

785
00:28:21,559 --> 00:28:22,519
Once you move in,

786
00:28:22,799 --> 00:28:24,640
hurry up and find a new husband.

787
00:28:25,079 --> 00:28:26,880
There's plenty of space, even with a kid.

788
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:27,359
It's perfect.

789
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:28,240
Sis,

790
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:29,799
the 20% down payment on the place,

791
00:28:29,799 --> 00:28:30,680
I've already paid it all for you.

792
00:28:31,519 --> 00:28:33,920
You and my future brother-in-law can just live there.

793
00:28:34,279 --> 00:28:35,119
I won't even charge you rent.

794
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:36,279
If he ever mistreats you,

795
00:28:36,279 --> 00:28:37,119
I'll kick him right out.

796
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:40,319
My family might buy around here.

797
00:28:41,200 --> 00:28:43,200
Where do you guys plan to buy?

798
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:45,720
Seeing each other in the future...

799
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:47,279
will be even harder.

800
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:54,599
Xiaowu.

801
00:28:55,839 --> 00:28:56,720
Look at you.

802
00:28:57,319 --> 00:28:58,640
You finally get some time off,

803
00:28:59,279 --> 00:29:00,480
instead of resting at home,

804
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:02,200
you come running all the way here to do homework.

805
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:03,920
Hurry up and head home.

806
00:29:04,359 --> 00:29:04,680
Dad,

807
00:29:05,119 --> 00:29:06,119
I won't head home just yet.

808
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:07,359
I'll stay with you a bit longer,

809
00:29:07,359 --> 00:29:08,200
then go straight to school.

810
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:09,759
In a little while,

811
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:11,839
I'm going to the provincial capital for a computer contest.

812
00:29:12,279 --> 00:29:12,960
There's intensive training too.

813
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:15,279
To the provincial capital?

814
00:29:15,400 --> 00:29:15,720
Yeah.

815
00:29:16,079 --> 00:29:17,680
It's a province-level competition this time.

816
00:29:18,319 --> 00:29:19,200
Our teacher said

817
00:29:19,680 --> 00:29:20,759
if I do well this time

818
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:21,799
and place in the contest,

819
00:29:22,160 --> 00:29:23,480
I'll qualify for direct university admission.

820
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:27,200
Our Xiaowu truly is the smartest.

821
00:29:27,599 --> 00:29:28,359
Do your best.

822
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:30,880
Whatever you lack or need,

823
00:29:31,039 --> 00:29:31,720
just tell Dad.

824
00:29:32,039 --> 00:29:33,200
This is a big deal.

825
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:33,759
Okay.

826
00:29:35,359 --> 00:29:35,640
By the way,

827
00:29:36,279 --> 00:29:37,400
there's one more thing.

828
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:39,279
Give Dad a hand.

829
00:29:39,680 --> 00:29:40,599
Help me look up

830
00:29:40,599 --> 00:29:41,240
a company called

831
00:29:41,559 --> 00:29:43,039
Tengyue Group.

832
00:29:43,519 --> 00:29:45,359
Where their headquarters is,

833
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:47,200
and what their exact address is.

834
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:48,880
Yeah, note it down:

835
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:51,680
"Teng" as in soaring,

836
00:29:52,839 --> 00:29:53,720
"Yue" as in leaping.

837
00:29:55,359 --> 00:29:55,680
Got it.

838
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:57,039
I'll look it up as soon as I get back.

839
00:29:57,160 --> 00:29:57,759
Good, good.

840
00:30:05,119 --> 00:30:05,480
Xiuming,

841
00:30:07,960 --> 00:30:08,920
we're brothers.

842
00:30:10,519 --> 00:30:11,359
I definitely want to help you,

843
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:14,400
but you have to tell me the truth.

844
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:15,559
Besides me,

845
00:30:15,559 --> 00:30:16,359
does anyone else know about this?

846
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:19,839
No one.

847
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:21,319
Can you just tell me the truth?

848
00:30:21,319 --> 00:30:21,839
Qianjin...

849
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:23,079
Qianjin...

850
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:35,119
Come on.

851
00:30:36,279 --> 00:30:37,559
Let me break down

852
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:38,519
the financial costs for you.

853
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:40,160
So you don't stay clueless

854
00:30:40,160 --> 00:30:41,440
and not even know what hit you.

855
00:30:42,039 --> 00:30:42,480
Even if

856
00:30:43,039 --> 00:30:43,839
you and Ma Laijiao

857
00:30:43,960 --> 00:30:45,240
have an unbreakable bond,

858
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:46,160
if you divorce Wen Jiayin,

859
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:48,039
she is entitled to at least

860
00:30:48,039 --> 00:30:49,200
half of your assets.

861
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:49,920
You know that, right?

862
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:51,240
You cheated.

863
00:30:51,240 --> 00:30:52,039
You're the at-fault party.

864
00:30:52,039 --> 00:30:53,519
She can petition the court

865
00:30:53,519 --> 00:30:54,440
for more compensation.

866
00:30:55,319 --> 00:30:56,359
In judicial practice,

867
00:30:56,359 --> 00:30:57,640
the court tends to favor the wife.

868
00:30:58,079 --> 00:30:58,400
On top of that,

869
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,119
Sai Zhenzhu is old enough.

870
00:31:00,319 --> 00:31:01,440
Whomever she chooses to live with,

871
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:03,680
the court will respect her wishes.

872
00:31:04,240 --> 00:31:04,880
Who do you think she'll pick?

873
00:31:05,519 --> 00:31:06,279
You know the answer.

874
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:07,960
Wen Jiayin has no income.

875
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:09,000
Raising the kid,

876
00:31:09,359 --> 00:31:10,960
you'll have to pay another

877
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:12,920
20 to 30 percent of your income

878
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:13,680
as child support every month.

879
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:15,519
Most importantly, listen up.

880
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:18,039
You have a share in the relocation payout.

881
00:31:18,480 --> 00:31:20,480
Wen Jiayin can petition the court

882
00:31:20,759 --> 00:31:22,359
to freeze the accounts

883
00:31:22,799 --> 00:31:24,240
to prevent asset transfers.

884
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:25,200
Do you understand?

885
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:26,920
Think you're the only one affected?

886
00:31:27,039 --> 00:31:28,119
You're screwing over the whole family!

887
00:31:29,559 --> 00:31:30,400
What I'm telling you right now

888
00:31:30,400 --> 00:31:31,960
is just basic legal advice.

889
00:31:31,960 --> 00:31:33,279
Any lawyer on the street

890
00:31:33,279 --> 00:31:34,000
would tell you the exact same thing.

891
00:31:34,599 --> 00:31:35,519
I can defend you,

892
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:36,680
but

893
00:31:36,960 --> 00:31:39,640
I can't stop her from taking legal action.

894
00:31:41,559 --> 00:31:42,319
Don't threaten me.

895
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:44,599
How is this a threat, Xiuming?

896
00:31:44,759 --> 00:31:46,319
Can you listen to reason for once?

897
00:31:46,319 --> 00:31:47,680
I'm trying to talk sense into you!

898
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,680
Xiuming, why can't you just, right now,

899
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:57,599
before Jiayin finds out,

900
00:31:57,680 --> 00:31:59,519
break it off with Ma Laijiao?

901
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:01,559
If this really blows up,

902
00:32:01,839 --> 00:32:02,799
what will Dad think of you?

903
00:32:03,319 --> 00:32:04,400
What will your daughter think of you?

904
00:32:04,559 --> 00:32:06,480
What will the neighbors think of you and Ma Laijiao?

905
00:32:06,759 --> 00:32:08,000
Can you handle the fallout?

906
00:32:14,359 --> 00:32:14,759
Xiuming.

907
00:32:16,720 --> 00:32:17,319
Sometimes,

908
00:32:18,880 --> 00:32:20,599
choices matter more than chances.

909
00:32:21,519 --> 00:32:22,240
Think it over.

910
00:32:40,799 --> 00:32:41,079
Dad.

911
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:41,720
Jingran.

912
00:32:42,880 --> 00:32:44,119
What are you doing here? Did you work the night shift?

913
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:45,519
I just got off and came to see you.

914
00:32:46,880 --> 00:32:48,640
I just spoke with your doctor.

915
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:50,599
He said you're recovering really well.

916
00:32:50,799 --> 00:32:51,599
Two more days of observation,

917
00:32:51,599 --> 00:32:52,279
and you can be discharged.

918
00:32:53,359 --> 00:32:54,920
That's great. That's wonderful.

919
00:32:55,960 --> 00:32:56,240
Careful.

920
00:32:58,640 --> 00:32:58,920
Dad,

921
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:00,839
I came to tell you something.

922
00:33:01,599 --> 00:33:03,799
The selection for our department head...

923
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:05,279
The results are out.

924
00:33:05,960 --> 00:33:07,240
I... I didn't get it.

925
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:09,559
The new department head just started.

926
00:33:09,720 --> 00:33:10,480
He's from Beijing.

927
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:11,680
I didn't tell you earlier

928
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:12,920
because you were in the hospital,

929
00:33:13,039 --> 00:33:13,759
and I didn't want to upset you.

930
00:33:14,759 --> 00:33:15,480
It's my fault.

931
00:33:19,119 --> 00:33:20,559
But Qianjin has moved back home.

932
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:21,440
Back to our home.

933
00:33:22,720 --> 00:33:24,160
The 50,000 you gave me before,

934
00:33:24,279 --> 00:33:24,839
I didn't spend it.

935
00:33:25,680 --> 00:33:26,559
I gave it all to Qianjin.

936
00:33:48,039 --> 00:33:49,240
What's the matter with you?

937
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,519
Yawning first thing in the morning?

938
00:33:52,039 --> 00:33:52,920
Didn't sleep well?

939
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:53,519
Just tired.

940
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:55,799
I was watching TV last night.

941
00:33:57,839 --> 00:33:59,519
Jingran told me...

942
00:33:59,519 --> 00:34:01,000
that you'd gone back home.

943
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:02,200
No, I didn't.

944
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:09,000
I just went home to use the computer.

945
00:34:10,119 --> 00:34:12,320
Jin Jingran and his daughter are doing fine.

946
00:34:12,639 --> 00:34:14,719
And I'm doing just fine staying here.

947
00:34:15,119 --> 00:34:16,719
Then tell Dad the honest truth.

948
00:34:17,199 --> 00:34:20,119
Do you still want to stay together with Jingran or not?

949
00:34:24,840 --> 00:34:26,000
I don't know.

950
00:34:27,880 --> 00:34:30,000
That means you can still make it work.

951
00:34:30,440 --> 00:34:32,519
There's a limit to everything.

952
00:34:32,880 --> 00:34:34,039
Don't push it too far.

953
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:36,039
By the way,

954
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:39,159
about Jingran not making director,

955
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:40,599
why didn't you mention that to me?

956
00:34:43,079 --> 00:34:44,519
That 50,000 yuan...

957
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:45,679
do you have it?

958
00:34:50,679 --> 00:34:51,719
If you're having any trouble,

959
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:53,679
just tell Dad directly.

960
00:34:55,079 --> 00:34:55,599
I don't.

961
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:58,480
Qianjin,

962
00:34:58,960 --> 00:35:00,559
out of all the kids in our family,

963
00:35:01,239 --> 00:35:03,280
you're the only one who can't lie.

964
00:35:04,199 --> 00:35:05,480
If something's going on

965
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:06,719
and you don't tell Dad,

966
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:08,599
how worried do you think I'll be?

967
00:35:09,239 --> 00:35:10,360
Even if Dad wants to help,

968
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:11,920
I won't be able to.

969
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:15,519
If there's something, just spit it out.

970
00:35:18,360 --> 00:35:19,400
If I tell you,

971
00:35:20,239 --> 00:35:21,440
you can't get mad, okay?

972
00:35:22,559 --> 00:35:23,599
Tell Dad the truth.

973
00:35:23,599 --> 00:35:24,679
Why would Dad get mad?

974
00:35:25,159 --> 00:35:25,480
Go ahead.

975
00:35:27,960 --> 00:35:29,840
I really couldn't find a job,

976
00:35:29,960 --> 00:35:32,639
so I partnered with Jiayin on a bridal shop.

977
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:34,639
That 50,000 yuan,

978
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:36,280
I gave it all to her.

979
00:35:38,519 --> 00:35:40,239
I'm... I'm a shareholder now.

980
00:35:41,039 --> 00:35:42,400
If you don't like it,

981
00:35:42,880 --> 00:35:45,519
just treat it as a loan from you.

982
00:35:45,639 --> 00:35:47,119
Once the bridal shop turns a profit,

983
00:35:47,400 --> 00:35:48,119
I'll pay you back.

984
00:35:48,119 --> 00:35:48,639
All right?

985
00:35:52,719 --> 00:35:54,199
You just said you wouldn't get mad,

986
00:35:54,199 --> 00:35:55,280
which is why I told you.

987
00:35:56,599 --> 00:35:57,079
If you act like this,

988
00:35:57,079 --> 00:35:57,800
whatever happens in the future,

989
00:35:57,800 --> 00:35:58,800
I won't tell you a thing.

990
00:36:02,079 --> 00:36:04,159
You're considering a mortgage, right?

991
00:36:04,480 --> 00:36:04,960
As for the mortgage,

992
00:36:04,960 --> 00:36:07,119
we go through the standard bank process.

993
00:36:07,480 --> 00:36:08,840
Say you take a 20-year term.

994
00:36:08,840 --> 00:36:09,519
Right now,

995
00:36:09,519 --> 00:36:10,280
your monthly payment

996
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:11,719
comes out to 8,693 yuan.

997
00:36:12,159 --> 00:36:13,039
And this apartment,

998
00:36:13,039 --> 00:36:14,000
the one we just looked at,

999
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:14,880
138 square meters,

1000
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:17,000
in Building 21,

1001
00:36:17,119 --> 00:36:18,639
the flagship building, 18th floor.

1002
00:36:19,519 --> 00:36:19,800
Right?

1003
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:21,719
This is the plan we currently have.

1004
00:36:24,440 --> 00:36:25,280
Hello, Jiayin.

1005
00:36:25,280 --> 00:36:26,280
So you finally answer the phone?

1006
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:27,039
How many times did I call?

1007
00:36:27,039 --> 00:36:27,639
Why didn't you pick up?

1008
00:36:27,920 --> 00:36:28,360
Where are you?

1009
00:36:29,920 --> 00:36:31,039
I'm in Dimiao Village.

1010
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,599
In... in my wife's hometown.

1011
00:36:32,719 --> 00:36:33,840
Her great-grandmother passed away,

1012
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:35,199
so I came back for the funeral.

1013
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:37,199
I've been rushed off my feet these past few days.

1014
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,320
I just saw your call.

1015
00:36:38,559 --> 00:36:39,559
Is something wrong, Jiayin?

1016
00:36:40,039 --> 00:36:41,119
Can you make it back today?

1017
00:36:41,599 --> 00:36:42,960
Definitely not today.

1018
00:36:43,679 --> 00:36:44,559
Tomorrow, let's say tomorrow.

1019
00:36:44,559 --> 00:36:45,599
Tomorrow should work.

1020
00:36:46,280 --> 00:36:46,760
Fine.

1021
00:36:47,280 --> 00:36:48,280
I'll let Xiuming know.

1022
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:49,239
Jiayin.

1023
00:36:49,800 --> 00:36:51,119
about reconciling the accounts,

1024
00:36:51,119 --> 00:36:51,880
once I'm back tomorrow,

1025
00:36:52,519 --> 00:36:53,159
I won't delay it.

1026
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:53,960
Hurry up, then.

1027
00:36:58,679 --> 00:36:59,239
Uncle!

1028
00:37:00,159 --> 00:37:00,840
Second Uncle Yang!

1029
00:37:01,519 --> 00:37:02,159
Second Uncle Yang, are you there?

1030
00:37:02,159 --> 00:37:03,480
What's all the shouting?

1031
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:04,400
It's such a small place!

1032
00:37:04,599 --> 00:37:04,880
Uncle,

1033
00:37:05,320 --> 00:37:06,519
is Yang Qingyou here?

1034
00:37:06,800 --> 00:37:07,079
No, he isn't.

1035
00:37:07,559 --> 00:37:08,239
Well... Uncle,

1036
00:37:08,239 --> 00:37:09,400
could you please

1037
00:37:09,440 --> 00:37:10,880
give Qingyou a call for me?

1038
00:37:11,039 --> 00:37:12,239
It's really urgent.

1039
00:37:12,760 --> 00:37:13,679
Why are you looking for your accountant

1040
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,280
at my place? Honestly.

1041
00:37:15,280 --> 00:37:16,039
I called him,

1042
00:37:16,039 --> 00:37:17,360
but he... he didn't pick up.

1043
00:37:24,079 --> 00:37:24,360
Look.

1044
00:37:25,400 --> 00:37:25,840
He's not answering either.

1045
00:37:27,159 --> 00:37:27,519
I mean,

1046
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:29,119
where could he have gone?

1047
00:37:30,400 --> 00:37:30,800
Jiayin.

1048
00:37:31,559 --> 00:37:32,760
I'm at Yang Er's place.

1049
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:33,880
Qingyou is in Dimiao Village.

1050
00:37:34,119 --> 00:37:35,320
He said Chunyan's great-grandmother died,

1051
00:37:35,320 --> 00:37:36,159
and went back for her funeral.

1052
00:37:36,519 --> 00:37:37,239
Who died?

1053
00:37:38,320 --> 00:37:39,880
Chunyan's great-grandmother.

1054
00:37:40,400 --> 00:37:42,519
Didn't Chunyan's great-grandmother die years ago?

1055
00:37:47,280 --> 00:37:47,760
Hello? Hello?

1056
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:50,400
Could... could...

1057
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:52,119
Could it be about the funds

1058
00:37:52,559 --> 00:37:54,719
I approved for equipment the other day?

1059
00:37:54,719 --> 00:37:56,760
Did Yang Qingyou run off with the money?

1060
00:37:56,760 --> 00:37:57,639
Go find him right now!

1061
00:37:58,079 --> 00:37:58,400
Okay, okay!

1062
00:38:21,400 --> 00:38:21,920
Qingyou!

1063
00:38:23,440 --> 00:38:24,000
Qingyou!

1064
00:38:26,559 --> 00:38:27,079
Chunyan!

1065
00:38:28,320 --> 00:38:28,800
Chunyan!

1066
00:38:36,159 --> 00:38:38,159
Third Uncle, have you seen Yang Qingyou?

1067
00:38:38,239 --> 00:38:39,480
That little brat dares to show his face?

1068
00:38:39,480 --> 00:38:40,199
He owes me money.

1069
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:41,079
How much does he owe you?

1070
00:38:41,960 --> 00:38:42,440
50,000.

1071
00:38:42,880 --> 00:38:43,480
Five bucks.

1072
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:45,360
Stop messing around. Honestly.

1073
00:38:51,239 --> 00:38:51,679
Chunyan!

1074
00:38:55,119 --> 00:38:56,159
Jiayin, what brings you here?

1075
00:38:56,639 --> 00:38:57,960
I just got back from grocery shopping.

1076
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:58,639
Why are you hiding?

1077
00:38:59,039 --> 00:38:59,400
I'm not.

1078
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:01,800
I was just going to close the door.

1079
00:39:02,599 --> 00:39:03,639
The door was never even closed.

1080
00:39:04,599 --> 00:39:05,079
Where's Qingyou?

1081
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:07,000
Probably at the construction site.

1082
00:39:07,039 --> 00:39:08,000
He said he's busy these days,

1083
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:08,840
so he's staying there for now.

1084
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:10,599
Jiayin, come in and sit down.

1085
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:14,639
Come on in and take a seat.

1086
00:39:16,039 --> 00:39:17,440
Jiayin, what are you doing over there?

1087
00:39:17,440 --> 00:39:18,360
Come sit down.

1088
00:39:19,599 --> 00:39:21,079
Qingyou isn't home.

1089
00:39:21,320 --> 00:39:22,000
Have a seat. Sit down.

1090
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:25,079
Do you need him urgently?

1091
00:39:25,360 --> 00:39:26,440
300,000 is missing from the accounts.

1092
00:39:26,920 --> 00:39:27,599
Qingyou knows about it.

1093
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:28,960
Now he's nowhere to be found.

1094
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:31,400
Jiayin, we all know

1095
00:39:31,639 --> 00:39:33,320
Qingyou isn't the type to act recklessly.

1096
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,000
That's right.

1097
00:39:34,199 --> 00:39:35,000
That's why I came looking for him,

1098
00:39:35,000 --> 00:39:36,440
because I know him.

1099
00:39:36,639 --> 00:39:38,000
What if something happened to him?

1100
00:39:38,559 --> 00:39:40,119
Jiayin, sit down first.

1101
00:39:40,599 --> 00:39:41,760
Let's not panic.

1102
00:39:42,079 --> 00:39:43,920
I haven't seen him in days either.

1103
00:39:49,079 --> 00:39:49,800
Looking at floor plans?

1104
00:39:50,079 --> 00:39:51,480
No, not at all.

1105
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:52,280
Right.

1106
00:39:53,320 --> 00:39:54,760
Your place really is due for an upgrade.

1107
00:39:54,960 --> 00:39:57,039
Jiayin, th-this is just for folding cardboard.

1108
00:39:57,320 --> 00:39:58,920
Did Qingyou use that money to buy property?

1109
00:39:59,079 --> 00:39:59,599
No.

1110
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:00,920
Definitely not.

1111
00:40:01,199 --> 00:40:02,480
Qingyou wouldn't dare.

1112
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:03,599
Tell me the truth.

1113
00:40:03,719 --> 00:40:04,840
Otherwise, if the police get involved,

1114
00:40:04,840 --> 00:40:05,679
it becomes a criminal matter.

1115
00:40:05,679 --> 00:40:05,960
No...

1116
00:40:06,119 --> 00:40:08,159
Jiayin, that really isn't true.

1117
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:08,800
Fine.

1118
00:40:09,679 --> 00:40:11,079
Since Qingyou can't be found anyway,

1119
00:40:12,239 --> 00:40:13,519
let's call the police and have them search for him.

1120
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:15,239
No, please don't, Jiayin!

1121
00:40:15,239 --> 00:40:18,199
Qingyou just made a foolish mistake, Jiayin!

1122
00:40:20,360 --> 00:40:21,000
Let me tell you

1123
00:40:21,159 --> 00:40:22,199
what makes this apartment so great.

1124
00:40:22,559 --> 00:40:23,599
Its view

1125
00:40:23,719 --> 00:40:24,360
and natural lighting

1126
00:40:24,360 --> 00:40:25,360
are the best in our compound.

1127
00:40:25,599 --> 00:40:26,480
They're selling really fast,

1128
00:40:26,559 --> 00:40:27,480
and only two units are left.

1129
